        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9004, Square Kitchen Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSo you're almost done picking out the perfect hardware for your kitchen. You have the <a href=\"/products/infinity-cabinet-pull-omnia-9009\">Infinity Cabinet Pulls</a> installed and the <a href=\"/products/infinity-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-9009p-415\">matching appliance pulls</a> on your refrigerator and oven; but what about those cabinet drawers? The Cabinet Knob is a perfect match for anything in <a href=\"/collections/omnia-cabinet-hardware\">Omnia's Ultima Collection</a>. It has a sharp, modern appeal. Available in modern colors, it is a great finishing touch for contemporary homes with clean lines. It is available in 3 sizes, so you'll find the perfect fit for doors and drawers of all sizes.\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 sizes</b>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9004/25:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1\" squared</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9004/32:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/4\" squared</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9004/40:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/2\" squared</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
